    "topic": "Referral Thresholds Across Domains",
    "cognitiveLevel": "Analysis",
    "text": "A wrestling coach describes two athletes making weight for the same tournament. Athlete M tracks his food intake carefully in the two weeks before weigh-in, reduces portion sizes modestly, and increases water-based cutting techniques in the final 24 hours, then returns to his normal eating pattern immediately after weigh-in with no distress about eating afterward. Athlete N also tracks intake, but has restricted well below his sports dietitian's prescribed energy target for the past two months, not just fight week, expresses intense anxiety about eating in front of teammates, and continues restricting even in the weeks furthest from any weigh-in. Which statement correctly identifies where the referral threshold falls between these two athletes?",
