    "text": "A collegiate soccer player is in a preseason phase with two training sessions per day, totaling roughly 3 hours of combined moderate-to-high intensity work daily, and wants to maximize glycogen resynthesis between sessions. Using standard sports nutrition carbohydrate intake guidelines based on training load, what daily carbohydrate intake range is most appropriate?",
