        "text": "Calculate a standard 1.0 g/kg pre-exercise carbohydrate recommendation from general sports nutrition guidelines, and also suggest she reduce her rapid-acting insulin dose by roughly 25% before practice, since this is a commonly cited exercise adjustment"
